            passiveEn = "Set Sail: Gain 5% Movement Speed.\nSkipper: Every 4th attack against champions and epic monsters deals bonus physical damage equal to 160% base plus 5%(ranged champions deal 40% of the damage), increased to 240% base plus 9%against structures (ranged champions deal 40% of the damage).\nBoarding Party: Nearby allied siege and super minions gain 20-130 Armor (25% bonus if you're a ranged champion) and 10-120 Magic Resistance() (25% bonus if you're a ranged champion).",
