            coachTipEn = "This item is the cornerstone of a powerful split‑push strategy. It provides significant health and attack damage, boosting both your survivability and tower‑breaking potential. The “Set Sail” passive steadily increases your movement speed, helping you rotate between lanes and avoid ganks. Every fifth attack on champions or epic monsters triggers “Skipper”, dealing hefty bonus physical damage—and even more against structures—making it indispensable for rapid turret takedowns. Additionally, “Boarding Party” buffs nearby allied siege and super minions with extra resistances, amplifying your split‑push threat. Perfect for solo laners who want to apply pressure on the map and force enemy responses without directly joining teamfights.",
